Date: Wed, 6 May 2026 12:18:05 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Add NBAPI for Policy Config Request and Beacon Metrics Query

Implement two new NBAPI functions:
- SendPolicyConfigRequest: Send policy config request to agent
- SendBeaconMetricsQuery: Query beacon metrics for specified STA with
  optional parameters (operating_class, channel, bssid, ssid)

Enhanced beacon response handler to  store measurements in
data model including RCPI, RSNI, channel, and operating class.

Signed-off-by: Mahitha M <mmaddulu@qti.qualcomm.com>
